    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The M-29 Incisor fires three-round bursts synchronized to fire simultaneously, sending a tight cluster of kinetic rounds down range with each trigger pull. The result is devastating at any range the scope can reach: all three rounds arrive before a target's kinetic barrier can begin cycling against the first hit. Alliance Special Forces units favor it precisely for this reason - a single squeeze can strip a shield and land all follow-through damage in one instant.</p>"
